@EmailTriage.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5074

### Login
POST {{EmailTriage.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@company.test",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Ingest + classify in one call
POST {{EmailTriage.Api_HostAddress}}/api/ingestion/run?max=10

### List departments
GET {{EmailTriage.Api_HostAddress}}/api/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List tickets (department-scoped to the logged-in user)
GET {{EmailTriage.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
